{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Geamana Village</strong> is a slow-paced, atmospheric investigative experience that invites you to explore a devastated place.\u00a0As you make your way through the last isolated homes spared by the flood, you\u2019ll speak with the few remaining locals, examine abandoned belongings, and uncover fragments of a life once lived. In the distance, the remnants of the village church still stand, silent, damaged, and waiting to be discovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigative Photography</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the ruins, the toxic lake, and haunting traces of the disaster. Each photo serves as both evidence and memory, revealing details overlooked by the eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051480/extras/ae52a14feed989fd54e140481706fe89.poster.avif?t=1758896015\" width=1000 height=563 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051480/extras/ae52a14feed989fd54e140481706fe89.webm?t=1758896015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interview Locals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak with the last remaining locals. Their trust must be earned and their stories often conflict, leaving you to decide what to believe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051480/extras/40a4040bfc7692afb515f1c389611664.poster.avif?t=1758896015\" width=950 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051480/extras/40a4040bfc7692afb515f1c389611664.webm?t=1758896015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search for Clues</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find letters, reports, personal notes, and official documents scattered across the village. Every page is a missing piece of the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051480/extras/e46bf3d1bb0125dc5699ad124d8846bd.poster.avif?t=1758896015\" width=950 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051480/extras/e46bf3d1bb0125dc5699ad124d8846bd.webm?t=1758896015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn Trust, Unlock Stories</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help locals with small tasks. Only those who trust you will share their deepest memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051480/extras/01442d8e2fac82238310d2cc8c46ec97.poster.avif?t=1758896015\" width=950 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051480/extras/01442d8e2fac82238310d2cc8c46ec97.webm?t=1758896015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore at Your Own Pace</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk at your own rhythm through a quiet, haunting space shaped by memory, silence, and irreversible damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051480/extras/0deb0116d94f6e2f821d4db4be5cb026.poster.avif?t=1758896015\" width=950 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051480/extras/0deb0116d94f6e2f821d4db4be5cb026.webm?t=1758896015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo details</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo of Geamana Village includes several early missions, introduces the core mechanics and reveals the first fragments of the drowned village\u2019s story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4051480?t=1758896015","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4051480?t=1758896015","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051480/23939c38bfe490a4ac261e48e8f8b7648e322057/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758896015","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051480/23939c38bfe490a4ac261e48e8f8b7648e322057/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758896015","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Geamana Village</strong> is a slow-paced, atmospheric investigative experience that invites you to explore a devastated place.\u00a0As you make your way through the last isolated homes spared by the flood, you\u2019ll speak with the few remaining locals, examine abandoned belongings, and uncover fragments of a life once lived. In the distance, the remnants of the village church still stand, silent, damaged, and waiting to be discovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigative Photography</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the ruins, the toxic lake, and haunting traces of the disaster. Each photo serves as both evidence and memory, revealing details overlooked by the eye.<